HYWSource is a procurement and supply chain consultancy founded by Quick Chan,
an MCIPS qualified procurement professional with 15+ years of experience in
international sourcing, supplier development and manufacturing coordination
across Asia.
</p>



<h2>
What We Do
</h2>
<p>
Explore our full range of procurement services including supplier sourcing,
factory evaluation, product development support and supply chain solutions.
</p>

